/body>)/Rect[222.546 261.227 395.347 287.612]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj55 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(This entity consists of a lamp, a mere incandescent lamp, installed in the ceiling of the kitchen freezer of one of the restaurants of the fast food chain çThe Beefshop!é, very famous throughout Loftanima and known for its iconic hamburger meat blends suc\h as the çAmoolyteé. Its anomaly consists of the light it emits, composed of waves in unknown frequencies and anomalous properties, but that have no effect when outside of its trigger condition. The branch is located north of Dropflight, operating until m\idnight, except on sundays, and the fry cook for the branch, Hugo Balaia, is an unpaid intern that used to get bored a lot during his shifts and, consequentially, played a lot with the work tools. In one of his shenanigans, he started to flicker the light\ switch constantly, while accidentally forgot to keep the freezer door open, locking himself inside and making the place completely dark. He did not know that complete darkness was the entityês trigger condition, and by, still, playing with the light swit\ch 10 more times, the anomaly took place, creating from the altered photons, a copy of Hugo. This copy had every feature, memories and cognition of the original body, however, they do have a different molecular composition, with high amounts of sugar and \muscular proteins, therefore being stronger, and with an extremely quicker metabolism, on top of showing exclusive alimentary preference to the meat of the original or former body, with reduced nutritional factors if they are introduced by different sourc\es and, consequentially, suffering worse effects if foreign substances are introduced. With that, a cycle was started, where the doppelganger killed its original body, escaped the freezer by destroying its wall and, later, utilized Hugo as a means of sust\enance, taking his place on the branch and selling his meat to the clients. Eventually, he ran out of stock, and while planning on getting additional help for his operations, the doppelganger summoned a second copy, not realizing that that would cause a d\ispute where the first one would end up being killed, and the second one would take its place. The current Hugo is his eighteenth version of the clone, which survived 3 previous fights \(against the nineteenth, twentieth and twenty first versions\), consi\derably refilling his stock.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Arial 8 Tf)/DS(font: Arial,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240919170216-03'00')/NM(d7acb930cdb148c288da8a71ac95f1c3)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="text-align:justify;font-family:Arial">This entity consists of a lamp, a mere incandescent lamp, installed in the ceiling of the kitchen freezer of one of the restaurants of the f\ast food chain &#8220;The Beefshop!&#8221;, very famous throughout Loftanima and known for its iconic hamburger meat blends such as the &#8220;Amoolyte&#8221;. Its anomaly consists of the light it emits, composed of waves in unknown frequencies and anomal\ous properties, but that have no effect when outside of its trigger condition. The branch is located north of Dropflight, operating until midnight, except on sundays, and the fry cook for the branch, Hugo Balaia, is an unpaid intern that used to get bored\ a lot during his shifts and, consequentially, played a lot with the work tools. In one of his shenanigans, he started to flicker the light switch constantly, while accidentally forgot to keep the freezer door open, locking himself inside and making the p\lace completely dark. He did not know that complete darkness was the entity&#8217;s trigger condition, and by, still, playing with the light switch 10 more times, the anomaly took place, creating from the altered photons, a copy of Hugo. This copy had eve\ry feature, memories and cognition of the original body, however, they do have a different molecular composition, with high amounts of sugar and muscular proteins, therefore being stronger, and with an extremely quicker metabolism, on top of showing exclu\sive alimentary preference to the meat of the original or former body, with reduced nutritional factors if they are introduced by different sources and, consequentially, suffering worse effects if foreign substances are introduced. With that, a cycle was \started, where the doppelganger killed its original body, escaped the freezer by destroying its wall and, later, utilized Hugo as a means of sustenance, taking his place on the branch and selling his meat to the clients. Eventually, he ran out of stock, a\nd while planning on getting additional help for his operations, the doppelganger summoned a second copy, not realizing that that would cause a dispute where the first one would end up being killed, and the second one would take its place. The current Hug\o is his eighteenth version of the clone, which survived 3 previous fights \(against the nineteenth, twentieth and twenty first versions\), considerably refilling his stock.</span></p></body>)/Rect[45.3301 45.264 571.302 206.874]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj56 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(   Dif)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 21.8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 21.8pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240913203319-03'00')/NM(1136aaeffc294a48afa27816b1ee9af3)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:21.8p